      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "2a",
          "title": "Chronological timeline",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "text": "On the morning of November 3, 2025, emergency assistance was requested on Imber Street after a structural collapse destroyed Aldan House and its east wing on Cobbett Row, disrupting local services.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                4,
                5,
                7,
                13
              ],
              "id": "2a.1"
            },
            {
              "text": "Later on November 3, Provincial Urban Search and Rescue deployed to the site, injuries were documented across Nerridge, the fire service rescued nine people, and Nerridge Emergency Management initiated updates.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                15,
                27,
                37,
                48
              ],
              "id": "2a.2"
            },
            {
              "text": "On November 4, search and rescue personnel successfully extracted trapped individuals from the rubble at Aldan House on Imber Street.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                72,
                73,
                75
              ],
              "id": "2a.3"
            },
            {
              "text": "On November 6, Provincial Urban Search and Rescue carried out further rescues as authorities continued to disseminate informational updates regarding the collapsed east wing.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                94,
                96,
                97
              ],
              "id": "2a.4"
            },
            {
              "text": "On November 8, fatalities caused by the collapse were confirmed, police deployed, hazardous conditions prompted the displacement of around 85 residents from Cobbett Row, and local assistance and crane restoration commenced.",
